--TEST--
A parameter with two `@param` lines is `E0331` on the second — `rule:tooling/doc-comment-tags-are-closed-and-checked`
--FILE--
<?nvs
// A parameter has one `@param` line.
final class Ledger {
    /// Adds one entry.
    ///
    /// @param $amount the amount to add
    /// @param $amount the amount again
    public static function add(int $amount): int {
        return $amount;
    }
}
echo Ledger::add(3), "\n";
--EXPECTF-ERROR--
error[E0331]: `$amount` is documented twice
  --> %s:7:9
  |
7 |     /// @param $amount the amount again
  |         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ a second `@param` for the same parameter
  = suggestion: delete this `@param` line (delete)

error: aborting due to 1 error
